# botmail-square-webhook-handler

A Botmail worker template for handling Square webhook events, specifically for subscription management and payment verification.

## Overview

This Worker template demonstrates how to process Square webhook events (`payment.updated`, `invoice.payment_made`, `subscription.updated`) and update workspace subscriptions accordingly.

## Setup

1. Create a Cloudflare Worker:
   ```bash
   npx wrangler init botmail-square-webhook --template=empty
   ```

2. Add dependencies:
   ```bash
   pnpm add @botmail/mcp-sdk
   ```

3. Configure environment variables in `wrangler.toml`:
   ```toml
   [env.production]
   VARIABLES = {
     BOTMAIL_API_URL = "https://api.botmail.work",
     SQUARE_ACCESS_TOKEN = "your_square_access_token",
     SQUARE_WEBHOOK_VERIFICATION_KEY = "your_webhook_verification_key",
   }
   ```

## Webhook Event Types

The worker handles the following Square webhook events:

### `payment.updated`
- Triggered when a payment status changes
- Updates workspace subscription status
- Generates tax invoice if payment completed

### `invoice.payment_made`
- Triggered when an invoice is paid
- Sends confirmation email to customer
- Updates workspace subscription if needed

### `subscription.updated`
- Triggered when subscription status changes
- Updates workspace tier and status
- Handles cancellation or reactivation

## Example Implementation

```js
export default {
  async fetch(request, env, ctx) {
    // Verify webhook signature
    const signature = request.headers.get('Square-Signature');
    if (!verifySquareSignature(request, signature)) {
      return new Response('Unauthorized', { status: 401 });
    }

    const body = await request.json();
    const eventType = body.event;

    switch (eventType) {
      case 'payment.updated':
        await handlePaymentUpdated(body.data);
        break;
      case 'invoice.payment_made':
        await handleInvoicePaid(body.data);
        break;
      case 'subscription.updated':
        await handleSubscriptionUpdated(body.data);
        break;
      default:
        // Ignore unknown events
    }

    return new Response('ok', { status: 200 });
  },
};
```

## Helper Functions

### Verify Square Signature

```js
function verifySquareSignature(request, signature) {
  if (!signature) return false;
  
  const body = await request.text();
  const hmac = crypto.createHmac('sha256', env.SQUARE_WEBHOOK_VERIFICATION_KEY);
  const expected = 'v1=' + hmac.update(body).digest('hex');
  
  return crypto.timingSafeEqual(
    Buffer.from(signature),
    Buffer.from(expected)
  );
}
```

### Handle Payment Updated

```js
async function handlePaymentUpdated(payment) {
  const { id, amount, status, } = payment;
  
  if (status !== 'COMPLETED') return;
  
  // Find or create workspace based on Square customer
  const workspace = await findWorkspaceBySquareCustomer(payment.customer_id);
  
  if (!workspace) return;
  
  // Update subscription status
  await env.DB.prepare(
    'UPDATE workspaces SET subscription_status = ?, updated_at = ? WHERE id = ?'
  )
  .bind('active', new Date().toISOString(), workspace.id)
  .run();
  
  // Generate tax invoice
  await generateTaxInvoice(workspace.id, payment.id, amount);
}
```